# MonsoonCast — what belongs in Git and what does not
#
# THE RULE: code, documentation and small reference data are tracked. Anything
# downloaded from a provider, and anything a script can regenerate, is not.
#
# This is not tidiness. The full working dataset is about 18 GB and individual
# files exceed GitHub's 100 MB hard limit, so a repository tracking the data
# could not be pushed at all. docs/02_DATA_EXTRACTION.md documents how to
# obtain or rebuild every ignored dataset, which is what makes ignoring it safe
# rather than lossy.

# --- Python -----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# --- Node / Vite ------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/

# --- Editor and OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.bak
*.tmp
~$*

# --- Downloaded source data -------------------------------------------------
# Re-fetch with the commands in docs/02_DATA_EXTRACTION.md
IMD_Data/raw/
IMD_Data/lgd/
IMD_Data/*.pkl
IMD_Data/*.log
Evapotranspiration_LGD/*.csv
SM_LGD/*.csv
TemperatureERA5_LGD/*.csv
Vegetation_LGD/*.csv
Chirps_LGD/*.csv
CFSv2_LGD/*.csv
GlobalIrrigation/*.csv
ECMWF_LGD/
UPAJ/

# --- Generated output -------------------------------------------------------
# All rebuilt by build_dashboard.py
v5/data/
v5/data_lgd/
v5/masters_lgd/
v5/dashboard_lgd/
v5/dashboard_react/src/data/

# --- Large binaries ---------------------------------------------------------
*.pkl
*.joblib
*.pt
*.parquet
*.grib2
*.grd

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# TRACKED ON PURPOSE. These negations must come last to override the patterns
# above. Without them the district registry and the map geometry would be
# ignored, and the build could not start on a fresh clone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!IMD_Data/registry_lgd791.csv
!IMD_Data/crosswalk_*.csv
!IMD_Data/*.json
!IMD_Data/lgd_shapefile/
!dashboard/
!.gitkeep
